OL,3,CMan arrested after gun shots heard
OL,4,Cnear York Mosque in early hours
OL,6,FPolice have increased patrols and
OL,7,Farrested a man after a gunshot was
OL,8,Fheard outside a mosque in York.
OL,10,FA noise was heard around 2:19 am on
OL,11,FThursday 30 July near York Mosque and
OL,12,FIslamic Centre off Lawrence Street on
OL,13,FBull Lane near the city centre.
OL,15,FA North Yorkshire police spokesperson
OL,16,Fsaid: "A 44-year-old man from York, a
OL,17,Fwhite UK national, has been arrested.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/3
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
