OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785437306
OL,3,CMan arrested after gun shots heard
OL,4,Cnear York Mosque in early hours
OL,6,F"It is too early to say what may have
OL,7,Fbeen the motivation behind this
OL,8,Fdisturbing incident, but our Muslim
OL,9,Fcommunity in York can be reassured
OL,10,Fthat we are doing everything we can to
OL,11,Festablish the full circumstances.
OL,13,FWe are also providing high-visibility
OL,14,Fpatrols in the vicinity of York Mosque
OL,15,Fas people attend for prayer.
OL,17,F"Our officers are due to meet with the
OL,18,FImam regarding the incident."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/3
