OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785437306
OL,3,CMan arrested after gun shots heard
OL,4,Cnear York Mosque in early hours
OL,6,FFollowing the disturbance the suspect
OL,7,Fleft the area in a silver vehicle
OL,8,Fwhich police managed to trace, leading
OL,9,Fto his arrest.
OL,11,FPolice believe it to have been an air
OL,12,Frifle and say no one was hurt in the
OL,13,Fincident.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/3
